							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b4b93db elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading"
								data-id="b4b93db" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="heading.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Nos missions</h2>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8f164d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor"
								data-id="8f164d3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Le réseau E&amp;D agit autour de cinq <br />missions principales pour des
										solidarités internationales ici et là-bas.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-16995a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button"
								data-id="16995a5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="button.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
