											</span>
										</a>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e87042e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
							data-id="e87042e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"
							data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ffacbc0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image"
								data-id="ffacbc0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="image.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="244" height="248"
										src="/engage/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/ed-accompagnement.png"
										class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1536" alt="" />
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0e2a2c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading"
								data-id="0e2a2c3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="heading.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">L'Accompagnement</h2>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-023553e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor"
								data-id="023553e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Nous offrons un parcours d’engagement individuel et collectif des jeunes dans la
										solidarité internationale,dans l’optique d’accompagner vers et de valoriser les
										engagements multiples en faveur d’un monde plus juste et solidaire.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a220075 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button"
								data-id="a220075" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="button.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm"
											href="/engage/missions/laccompagnement/">
											<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
												<span class="elementor-button-text">En savoir plus</span>
											</span>
										</a>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-73bee7a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
							data-id="73bee7a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"
							data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7338834 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image"
								data-id="7338834" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="image.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="244" height="248"
										src="/engage/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/ed-sensibiliser.png"
										class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1539" alt="" />
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ff11f3f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading"
								data-id="ff11f3f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="heading.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Sensibiliser
										aux enjeux globaux</h2>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cb47708 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor"
								data-id="cb47708" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Dans une démarche d’éducation à la citoyenneté et à la solidarité internationale
										(ECSI), nous sensibilisons les jeunes, acteurs du monde associatif, étudiants,
										professionnels, sur les enjeux globaux, afin de prendre conscience de leur
										pouvoir d’agir dans un monde interdépendant.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2bc17c3 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button"
								data-id="2bc17c3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="button.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm"
											href="/engage/missions/sensibiliser-aux-enjeux-globaux/">
											<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
												<span class="elementor-button-text">En savoir plus</span>
											</span>
										</a>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fc964e3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
							data-id="fc964e3" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"
							data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4666a32 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image"
								data-id="4666a32" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="image.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="244" height="249"
										src="/engage/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/ed-voix-messages.png"
										class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1540" alt="" />
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f9abb08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading"
								data-id="f9abb08" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="heading.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Les voix <br>
										et messages <br>
										du réseau</h2>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-28e6df2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor"
								data-id="28e6df2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget"
								data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
								<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>En tant que réseau, nous valorisons et portons la voix des jeunesses dans et pour
										la solidarité internationale, comme acteur·rices nécessaires et légitimes dans
										notre société actuelle.</p>
